  "title": "Feed & Groups: New tools to strengthen internal communication",
  "summary": "Internal communication relies on different formats, channels, and publishing moments. Having tools that support that dynamic makes it easier to adapt every message to your organization’s needs. With these updates, the Feed & Groups module introduces new ways to schedule content, create posts across devices, and encourage employee engagement. Share posts across your entire organization […]",
